{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/CKMA1HJdbRbK6f_FvalgxQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:46.701853+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/CKMA1HJdbRbK6f_FvalgxQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><em><span>MASTER </span></em></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>夏令营</strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p>Guanghua School of Management</p><p>Peking University</p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>北京大学光华管理学院设有金融（金融学方向、科创金融方向、商业分析方向）及会计等全日制专业学位硕士项目。金融硕士多年来位于亚洲领先阵营，在全国金融硕士专业学位评估中名列前茅；会计硕士在全国首次专业学位水平评估中获评A+。在2025年QS世界大学学科排名中，北京大学会计学与金融学排名第14位。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>为增进全国优秀大学生对北京大学光华管理学院金融硕士、会计硕士项目的了解，特举行夏令营活动。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/31AwxT21gkNbj8H0DE29LoAjiaUVbmh6Gu31PNJzMFLalic6YrxUAUxAnvKYVos7pCxpQeC6dzohTEdtE2JicOf5Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><br/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><em>Guanghua</em></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong>申请条件</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong></strong></span></p><p>1. 全国高校 2026 届应届本科毕业生。</p><p>2. 学习成绩优秀，专业（方向）不限，鼓励跨专业申请。</p><p>（1）金融硕士申请人应对金融学有浓厚兴趣，其中金融学方向申请人具有经管学科背景尤佳；科创金融方向申请人具有理工科背景尤佳；商业分析方向申请人应具有良好的高等数学基础，熟悉至少一种数据分析编程语言（例如：R、Python）。</p><p>（2）<span>会计硕士申请人应对会计、财务有浓厚兴趣，具有理工科背景尤佳。</span><span></span></p><p>3. 英语水平良好。</p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><em>Guanghua</em></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong>申请方式</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p>请在申请系统中注册、填写资料及查阅模板，网址：https://apply.gsm.pku.edu.cn/#/pm/status</p><p>1. 《北京大学光华管理学院专业硕士申请表》（系统生成）。</p><p>2. 个人简历（中英文）。</p><p>3. 个人陈述（从系统下载模板）。</p><p>4. 在线推荐信3封（中英文均可，其中2封须由相关学科具有副教授(含)以上或相当职称的专家提供）。注：本院申请人免交。</p><p>5. 本科前5学期成绩单及排名证明，加盖学校或院系教务部门公章。网上填报排名须与排名证明一致，不一致者视为报名无效。注：金融硕士金融学方向和科创金融方向的第二批可提供前6学期成绩单。</p><p>6. 英语水平证明：国家英语四级/六级、TOEFL、GRE、GMAT、雅思等考试成绩单。</p><p>7. 各类竞赛、个人特长、荣誉奖励等相关证书（如有）。</p><p>8. 体现自身创新能力的代表性学术论文、出版物或原创性工作成果等材料（如有）。</p><p><br/></p><p><strong>特别提示：</strong></p><p>1.申请人仅限申请一个专业（方向），且不得申请2025年北京大学光华管理学院全国优秀大学生学术夏令营，申请提交后无法修改。</p><p>2.申请人须准确填写身份证号码及姓名，填写有误则报名无效。</p><p>3.申请人在线申请期间无需邮寄纸质材料，获得入营资格后须提交纸质材料，纸质材料不予退回。</p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><em>Guanghua</em></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong>申请时间</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong>1. 金融硕士（金融学方向、科创金融方向）</strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>第一批：</span><span>2025年4月3日00:00-4月21日12:00</span></p></section></section><section><section><p>第二批：<span>2025年7月2日00:00-8月18日12:00</span></p><p><span><strong><br/></strong></span></p><p><span><strong>2. 金融硕士（商业分析方向）</strong></span></p><p>2025年4月3日00:00-4月28日12:00</p><p><strong><br/></strong></p><p><strong>3. 会计硕士</strong></p><p>2025年4月3日00:00-4月28日12:00</p><p><br/></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>*入营安排根据申请、初审情况确定。金融硕士（金融学方向、科创金融方向）上一批次申请且未入营，则申请延续到下一批次。夏令营具体安排另行通知。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/31AwxT21gkNbj8H0DE29LoAjiaUVbmh6GmEOo6YZlTduYOG4QQysbNxSzkr3XdsNZ6StPPbtMb4aibx8ns1g5syQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>4月03日00:00</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong>报名启动</strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>4月21日12:00<strong></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong>MFin第一批截止</strong></span><span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>4月28日12:00</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong>BA、MPAcc截止</strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>7月02日00:00<strong></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong>MFin第二批启动</strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>8月18日12:00<strong></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong>MFin第二批截止</strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><secti